Hi! 👋  
This is SGKSS NGO, a website I built for a non-profit organization during my internship.  

🌍 Live Site: https://sgkssngo.org/

About the Project
The website was made to share information about the NGO’s social activities, projects, and donation programs.  
The goal was to make it simple, informative, and trustworthy so people can easily connect or contribute.  

Tech I Used
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript  
- Bootstrap  
- AI(for frontend Structure creation)
- PHP + MySQL  
- Hosted with cPanel  

Features
- Pages for mission, vision, and activities  
- Donation and volunteer forms  
- Event gallery  
- Mobile responsive layout  
- Contact page with email integration  

My Role
I handled everything from UI design to coding .  
It was a meaningful project because it combined tech with social good ❤️  

How to View
You can clone the project and just open `index.html` to explore it locally.  

